This licence covers the source code in this repository. Two things it
distributes or downloads carry their own terms, recorded where they live:

- The recorded piano the app offers to download is the Salamander Grand Piano
  V3 by Alexander Holm, under the Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 licence
  (CC-BY-3.0). It is not part of this repository; its source, down to the
  checksum of its own LICENSE file, is pinned in
  packages/sample-pack/sources.lock.json.
- Each score states its own provenance and licence in its metadata. The scores
  the app bundles are public domain; the two in scores/ are original and CC0.
